request.description:
⚡ SSE Streaming endpoint — streams AI response tokens in real-time.

⚠️ POSTMAN NOTE: Postman shows the full SSE response body once complete (not live). To see actual streaming, use: curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ai-advisor/chat/stream -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H 'Cookie: token=YOUR_JWT' -d '{"message":"Analyze my spending","sessionId":"default"}'

Each SSE event is a JSON object prefixed with 'data: ':
• data: {"type":"status","label":"Understanding your request..."}
• data: {"type":"tool_start","name":"get_spending_summary","label":"Analyzing your spending..."}
• data: {"type":"tool_result","name":"get_spending_summary","summary":"Found 42 records"}
• data: {"type":"text_delta","text":" Your total "}
• data: {"type":"message_complete","messageId":123,"sessionId":"...","toolsUsed":[...]}
• data: {"type":"pending_action","actionId":"...","toolName":"delete_expense","summary":"..."}
• data: {"type":"error","error":"..."}
